flowchart LR
    CFG[HOCON / typed rules] --> PARSE[Validated parser]
    PARSE --> IR[Immutable rule + metric IR]
    IR --> PLAN[Capability-aware planner]

    PLAN --> DEQ[PyDeequ adapter]
    PLAN --> SPK[Native Spark adapter]
    PLAN --> DF[Arrow / DataFusion adapter]
    PLAN --> GX[Great Expectations adapter]

    DEQ --> OUT[Typed bounded outcomes]
    SPK --> OUT
    DF --> OUT
    GX --> OUT
    OUT --> EVID[Evidence / sinks]

    classDef owned fill:#e8f4ff,stroke:#1b6ca8,stroke-width:2px,color:#102a43
    classDef adapter fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#ad7b00,stroke-width:2px,color:#3d2c00
    classDef result fill:#e9f8ee,stroke:#238636,stroke-width:2px,color:#12351b
    class PARSE,IR,PLAN owned
    class DEQ,SPK,DF,GX adapter
    class OUT,EVID result
